                                "sense_id": "76e3f48c-9737-3ce9-934b-ac3b0a611a09",
                                "text": "The 'old-look' and the 'bald-pink-and-wrinkled-look' are, in this context at least, one and the same. Phenomenally speaking, that is, the predicates 'old' and 'bald, pink, and wrinkled' here are equivalent […]"
